    "type_designations": ["LXH-15", "LXH-20", "LXHY-15", "LXHY-20", "LXHY-15/S", "LXHY-20/S"],
    "description": "Volumetric (semi-positive displacement rotary piston) water meters with wet mechanical indicating device with protected registered drums. Body of brass (LXH, LXHY) or composite (LXHY-15/S, LXHY-20/S), divided into two parts connected by screws, with connecting screw threads, inlet strainer, wet measuring unit with piston and mechanical transmission, rubber O-ring, and a mechanical indicating device protected by a plastic cover. The indicating device consists of numbered rollers with eight drums installed in a capsule filled with special liquid. Not designed to measure reverse flow. Intended for mounting on pipework with the flow axis in the horizontal and vertical (bottom-to-top and top-to-bottom) plane, with the indicating device positioned at the top or at the side. To prevent tampering, the brass or composite body parts are sealed together with a wire and lead seal."
